Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:20:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Eduka-Orca: LXQt integration and system-wide overridable
 defaults

- eduka-orca launcher, eduka-orca-toggle (menu entry, notification
  feedback), eduka-orca-autostart for lxqt-session (which ignores
  AutostartCondition)
- QT_ACCESSIBILITY=1 via profile.d and environment.d so LXQt/Qt apps
  are readable; toolkit-accessibility on via gschema override
- Super+Alt+S snippet for lxqt-globalkeyshortcuts
- rate/pitch/volume and caption settings honour *.gschema.override
  vendor defaults, so schools can tune them without patching code
- README.Eduka.md (Indonesian + English)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
